/// @file sti_groups.dox
/// @brief Doxygen module group definitions for the STI track-finding infrastructure.
///
/// This file defines the nine functional module groups that organise the STI
/// (STAR Track-finding Infrastructure) documentation.  It contains no code;
/// it is parsed only by Doxygen.

/// @defgroup StiMemoryModel Base Memory Model
/// @brief Object factory and pooling infrastructure.
///
/// The memory model provides heap-efficient object allocation for the high-rate
/// track-finding code.  Rather than calling `new`/`delete` for every hit,
/// track, and track node in each event, STI uses a growing-pool factory
/// (`StiFactory<T>`) that pre-allocates blocks of objects and recycles them
/// between events.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `Factory<T>` — abstract factory interface (getInstance, reset).
/// - `BFactory` — concrete factory that allocates individual objects with `new`.
/// - `StiFactory<Abstract, Concrete>` — growing-pool factory; doubles the pool
///   on overflow.  One instance per object type (hits, nodes, tracks).
/// - `StiTreeNode` — raw tree-link base; parent/child/sibling navigation.
/// - `StiCompositeTreeNode<T>` — typed tree node with data payload; used for
///   both the detector tree and the track-node chain.

/// @defgroup StiDetectorGeometry Detector Geometry
/// @brief Representation of the physical structure of the STAR detector.
///
/// This group covers the geometry pipeline: shapes define sensitive volumes,
/// materials carry energy-loss properties, placements locate elements in the
/// STAR global frame, and detectors bundle all geometry information together.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiShape` → `StiPlanarShape`, `StiCylindricalShape` — shape abstractions.
/// - `StiMaterial` — Z, A, density, radiation length X0 for a material.
/// - `StiElossCalculator` — Bethe-Bloch energy-loss calculator.
/// - `StiPlacement` — position and orientation in the global frame.
/// - `StiIsActiveFunctor` — acceptance functor for sensitive regions.
/// - `StiDetector` — one sensitive element aggregating shape/material/placement.
/// - `StiDetectorBuilder` — abstract base; one concrete subclass per sub-detector.
/// - `StiMasterDetectorBuilder` — aggregates all sub-detector builders.
/// - `StiDetectorContainer` — ordered array for sequential propagation.
/// - `StiDetectorTreeBuilder` — assembles the full detector tree.

/// @defgroup StiHitsAndTracks Hits and Track Representation
/// @brief Data classes for measured hits and reconstructed track candidates.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiHit` — one measured space point on a sensitive element.
/// - `StiNodePars` — 5-parameter Kalman state (y, z, η, κ, tanλ) + covariance.
/// - `StiKalmanTrackNode` — one node of the Kalman helix; aggregates state,
///   hit, detector, and chi² contribution.
/// - `StiKalmanTrack` — doubly-linked chain of nodes; provides track-level
///   quality accessors (pt, eta, chi2, nHits).
/// - `StiKTNIterator` — STL-compatible iterator over a track's nodes.

/// @defgroup StiTrackFinding Track Finding
/// @brief Combinatorial Kalman track-finding algorithms.
///
/// Seeds from the CA-TPC seeder are extended inward and outward through the
/// full detector tree by `StiKalmanTrackFinder`.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiKalmanTrackFinder` — main finder; drives the inward → outward loop.
/// - `StiCATpcSeedFinder` — converts CA seeds to initial Kalman states.
/// - `StiCATpcTrackerInterface` — bridge between CA and Kalman data structures.
/// - `StiLocalTrackSeedFinder` — local hit-triplet seeder for non-TPC detectors.

/// @defgroup StiTrackFitting Track Fitting
/// @brief Kalman smoother and track-fit quality utilities.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiKalmanTrackFitter` — full Kalman smoother refit of a found track.
/// - `QaFit` — per-track fit quality accumulator (inner class of KTFitter).
/// - `StiMcsErrs` — multiple-Coulomb-scattering error increments.
/// - `StiTrackNodeHelper` — computes gain matrix and chi² for one measurement update.

/// @defgroup StiHitLoading Hit Loading
/// @brief Infrastructure for loading sub-detector hits into the STI hit container.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiHitLoader<Source,Builder>` — abstract template; one concrete subclass
///   per sub-detector (TPC, IST, PXL, SSD, SVT).
/// - `StiMasterHitLoader` — calls each loader in sequence.
/// - `StiHitContainer` — indexed container of all hits for the current event;
///   supports nearest-neighbour lookup keyed by (refAngle, position).

/// @defgroup StiVertexFinding Vertex Finding
/// @brief Abstract interface and implementations for primary-vertex finding.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiVertexFinder` — abstract interface: `fit(StEvent*)`, `getVertex(i)`,
///   `size()`, `clear()`.  Implementations use different strategies
///   (PPV, minuit minimiser, …).

/// @defgroup StiWorkflow Workflow and Steering
/// @brief Top-level STAR maker that orchestrates the full tracking chain.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `StiMaker` — inherits `StMaker`; `Init()` builds geometry and allocates
///   factories; `Make()` loads hits, finds tracks, fits tracks, fills StEvent;
///   `Finish()` writes debug output.
/// - `StiToolkit` — service locator that vends factories, containers, and the
///   detector/track containers to all clients.
/// - `StiDetectorGroup` / `StiDetectorGroups` — registry of sub-detector units.

/// @defgroup StiUtilities Utilities and Infrastructure
/// @brief Shared utilities used across all STI categories.
///
/// **Key classes:**
/// - `Named` — name-string mixin (nearly all STI classes inherit this).
/// - `Described` — description-string mixin.
/// - `Filter<T>` — abstract predicate functor.
/// - `StiDebug` — static debug-level control and in-memory histogramming.
/// - `StiPullEvent` — pull-distribution data class for fit-quality monitoring.
/// - `Parameter`, `Parameters`, `EditableParameter`, `EditableParameters`,
///   `ConstrainedParameter` — tunable-parameter infrastructure.
/// - `SubjectObserver` — lightweight observer-pattern base classes.
